
Following are some of the planned features of CNet Amiga, in no particular order:


                             WORKS IN-PROGRESS
                             -----------------
1. MIME support.
2. Mailing-list support - currently partially working; to be expanded so CNet
   can operate as a mailing-list processor.

                                  FUTURE
                                  ------

1. DCC support for CNetIRC.
2. General improvement of CNetIRC to make it more "CNet-like".
3. Web server support (aka httpd).
4. Combining of CNet online/local finger and an internet Finger client.
5. FTP/FTPd support.
6. telnetd support
